# Enemy NPC unit (also the barracks' Grunt): sphere body, HEALTH ONLY - like the Swarm it
# carries NO Component Force: no bubble, no shield battery, no GPU readbacks. Enemy fields still
# SHOVE it and burn it through the BAKED pressure field (GameUnitComponent's shield-less branch:
# a CPU tap of the field + its gradient; the bubble-radius check is only the fallback when the
# bake is off), and it still strains emitters (EmitterDrain). Steers toward the nearest structure
# and gnaws it in attack range. ContactEvents feed projectile hit damage.
Prefab gameEnemyGrunt
	CullMode RootOnly         # one spatial entry for the body parts; it is also what gameplay queries find
	Component Scene
		Prefab CubeGuy        # the model: GameUnit turns it to the heading and feeds its walk
			Position 0 0.69 0
			Scale 0.28
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.5
		Density 100
		Friction 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
		ShortName GRNT
		Color 1 0.4 0.15
		Team 1
		HealthMax 60
		EnergyMax 0
		ShieldOutput 0
		AttackInterval 1.0
		AttackDamage 6
		PlayerDamage 10
		EmitterDrain 2
